DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/logs/explorer/datasets/{dataset_id}
Deletes a Log Explorer dataset for the account. Dataset deletion must not be protected.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; dataset_id (path) — Log Explorer dataset ID.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/logs/explorer/datasets/{dataset_id}
Retrieve a single Log Explorer dataset by ID for the account.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; dataset_id (path) — Log Explorer dataset ID.

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/logs/explorer/datasets/{dataset_id}
Updates the enabled state and/or field configuration of an account dataset.
Required: account_id (path) — Cloudflare account ID.; dataset_id (path) — Log Explorer dataset ID.; body (body)
